{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5001_p", "source_sha256": "0f0acb47651f4c2aca96c321e04ef442e2be98e11ba4ec516d09bcd26f8727c9", "ja": "（今日は『放課後デート』をイメージした動画撮影だ。\n可憐の様子は……なんだか落ち着かないみたいだな）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄以《放学后约会》为主题的视频。可怜的状态……总觉得有些坐立不安啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5002_045kar", "source_sha256": "5cc6f06ca338c697331f8a9415bb6e48f226e97bf292613bcf382009b94968f0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、放課後デートで\nカラオケって定番、なんです……よね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，放学后约会去\n卡拉OK是很常见的选择……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5003_p", "source_sha256": "ddc4df74e55bfa3115701e4a863f028d1a1e5ac09526edd4dea45099933da1de", "ja": "まあ、学生は行きやすいだろうしな。\n可憐はカラオケ、ピンとこないのか？", "zh": "不过，学生确实比较容易去嘛。可怜你对卡拉OK没什么感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5004_045kar", "source_sha256": "ff2a668a14943e18bd8b9fc393da6f3bf0a31eb10be33c58241410794433f33b", "ja": "えっ……い、いえ、ふたりっきりでカラオケって、\n考えただけでも……うぅ、みんな凄いなぁ。", "zh": "诶……不、不，我只是想到要两个人单独去唱卡拉OK，就……呜呜，大家都好厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5005_045kar", "source_sha256": "c5d12d0c16a89f26ee4a539cdb495398d3b752503b5f0695e1a93918eb25dd9c", "ja": "ううん、私も頑張らないと……！　見てくれた人に、\nデート気分になってもらえるように……。", "zh": "不行，我也得努力才行……！要让看到的人感受到约会的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5006_045kar", "source_sha256": "2ffa1fe7438bafc427afa1d584c902d401c93022cbf1b3ef1d7edd1660c528fb", "ja": "あ、それで……今日、選曲も任されていますけど……。\nな、何を歌ったらいいんでしょうか……？", "zh": "啊，对了……今天还让我负责选歌……。\n那、那我该唱什么歌才好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5007_p", "source_sha256": "7359b70de5187295902545e9e0bc95ed8d67021b63c34d16cb7ac22bb1c9484a", "ja": "ふむ。デートのときの選曲か。\nそれなら……。", "zh": "嗯……约会时要选唱的歌啊。\n那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5008", "source_sha256": "ed23efad82f12a82d09563fd1e04e03c79b4fddf4bf93dd8990e099dc24e8bd7", "ja": "ラブソング", "zh": "情歌", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5009", "source_sha256": "fa1f17c5dc6e5f93ef03b80f61853d1bd6fc107d00166ae505351ad731e3274a", "ja": "盛り上がる曲", "zh": "带动气氛的歌曲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5200_p", "source_sha256": "351db2db4c0dc489adcb7082081466942d74c3a56a432fdb2f22f5f6b5b3e8f4", "ja": "せっかくのデートなんだし、やっぱりラブソングかな？\n相手もドキドキすると思うし。", "zh": "难得是约会，果然还是情歌吧？\n对方应该也会小鹿乱撞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5201_045kar", "source_sha256": "e9bdda73f4bcb80445a3b1623f40036c5f622fd88b3fe394b702a95e0ad024e3", "ja": "えっ、ふ、ふたりっきりでカラオケでもすごいのに、\nラ、ラブソングなんて……うぅ。", "zh": "诶？两、两个人单独去唱卡拉OK就已经够不得了，居、居然还要唱情歌……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5202_045kar", "source_sha256": "05f3c530b24163991e3d79dfb4e2c6439fe4d4ac60f239f95b59f6c18f65b489", "ja": "でも……ふたりにとって、大切な時間、なんですよね。\nちょっとだけ、背伸びしてみます……てへへ♪", "zh": "不过……对我们两个人来说，这是段重要的时光，对吧。那我就稍微鼓起勇气试试看……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5300_p", "source_sha256": "351db2db4c0dc489adcb7082081466942d74c3a56a432fdb2f22f5f6b5b3e8f4", "ja": "せっかくのデートなんだし、やっぱりラブソングかな？\n相手もドキドキすると思うし。", "zh": "难得是约会，果然还是情歌吧？\n对方应该也会小鹿乱撞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5301_045kar", "source_sha256": "019c8e4847d47b60dc6a05ebb021453f720215ab9da3812c33a8db74ab799eeb", "ja": "えっ、ラブソング……。相手を……、\nこ、恋人を見ながら、歌ったりとか……？", "zh": "诶，情歌……要、要看着对方……也、也就是恋人，唱歌什么的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5302_045kar", "source_sha256": "39b90fee511f1ee34c2567dfa30691653fd5fe7476f74ef67f2dabab1b26ec6a", "ja": "あう……ド、ドキドキしすぎて、ぎこちなく\nなっちゃうかも……で、でも、やってみます……！", "zh": "啊呜……心、心跳得太厉害了，可能会变得很不自然……但、但是，我会试试看的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5500_p", "source_sha256": "3ab70e6325205ed75252d9958af428a16f8020ce5a9c8e510c3266c95ab30551", "ja": "せっかくのデートだからな。\n一緒に盛り上がれる曲なんか、いいと思うぞ。", "zh": "毕竟是难得的约会嘛。\n选一首能一起嗨起来的歌，我觉得就挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5501_045kar", "source_sha256": "c3453cfed9e054a9f918d0f2a87df5f054f4a3f5e0f6156bdfff526cb9f3f396", "ja": "た、確かに……。相手の男の子だって緊張してる\nかもしれませんし、その方がより仲が深まるかも……。", "zh": "确、确实……对方那个男孩子可能也会紧张，这样或许还能让彼此的关系更加亲近……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5502_045kar", "source_sha256": "9cc440c271fc172dda35de718420f653391e055edda899cba0f812810bb7e02f", "ja": "こ、ここは、女の子からリードできるように……\nがんばって、盛り上げてみせます……！", "zh": "既、既然要让女孩子来带动气氛……我、我会努力活跃气氛的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5600_p", "source_sha256": "3ab70e6325205ed75252d9958af428a16f8020ce5a9c8e510c3266c95ab30551", "ja": "せっかくのデートだからな。\n一緒に盛り上がれる曲なんか、いいと思うぞ。", "zh": "毕竟是难得的约会嘛。\n选一首能一起嗨起来的歌，我觉得就挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5601_045kar", "source_sha256": "1cdfc77020802ec9eb37a7a37fa319e3f46510978741b05b239242a453a261ba", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……盛り上がると、\n緊張もとけるかもしれないですし……。", "zh": "是、是啊……气氛热烈起来的话，说不定也能缓解紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_5602_045kar", "source_sha256": "b7599e594f9839fbca3299f1561f91984ba0154bdb9fbe76d4ac90c5c05b2059", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さん、撮影中\nこっそりコールしてもらっても……い、いいですか？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，拍摄的时候，\n可以悄悄帮我喊call吗……可、可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
